0993           1123   ; These are the pins used for the keypad in this program:
0993           1124   ROW1 EQU P1.2
0993           1125   ROW2 EQU P1.4
0993           1126   ROW3 EQU P1.6
0993           1127   ROw4 EQU P2.0
